{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1400132-alien-invasion-splat-reactions-responses","id":1400132,"title":"Alien Invasion: Splat Reactions + Responses","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-30T10:29:45-07:00","id":1400132,"title":"Alien Invasion: Splat Reactions + Responses","content":"On January 1st, in the year 20XX, a message was received by Governments and World Leaders across the globe, warning them of an impending invasion by an alien species. The one sending the message claims to be part of another extraterrestrial race that stands against the first one, and thought it\u2019d be a good idea to warn the denizens of planet Earth of the danger their in. Alien race dos is working on delaying the would be invaders as much as possible, but are unable to halt them entirely.<br /> <br /> \u201cEven with all we\u2019re doing, they\u2019ll be arriving in [ten] of your planetary rotations. I advise that you all admit to any secrets you\u2019ve been hiding from each other, forgive any ongoing grudges, debts and so on, or at least put them aside for now, and get to working together, or as close to that as you can manage. May the [Judges] guide you to victory, because by the [Spirits] you\u2019ll be needing it.\u201d<br /> <br /> How do you lot think that the various Splats, both \u2018Canonical\u2019 and \u2018Fan-Made\u2019 would react to such and their overall responses to it, in the short, medium and long terms?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-30T16:39:48-07:00","id":1400206,"title":"","content":"I feel like a decent subset of the Vampires would be focused heavily on the questions &quot;Do they have Blood (That I can Drink)&quot; and &quot;Can I Embrace them?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/509-tiwaztyrsfist","name":"TiwazTyrsfist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-18T17:33:46-07:00","id":1403442,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TiwazTyrsfist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1400132-alien-invasion-splat-reactions-responses?p=1400206#post1400206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel like a decent subset of the Vampires would be focused heavily on the questions &quot;Do they have Blood (That I can Drink)&quot; and &quot;Can I Embrace them?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Too true, too true.<br /> <br /> Also, as a clarification, the reason I put Judges and Spirits inside [these], is because an advanced alien species capable of invading Earth would almost certainly know of the Shadow and it\u2019s spiritual denizens by now (and <i>maybe</i> the Hisil and Gauntlet as well), along with an, at minimum, peripherally horizonal (as in extremely distant) awareness of both the Duat and the Judges and (since their language would be, well, <i>alien</i> to us) those would be the closest, most accurate words in the human vernacular.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":25791,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","user":"TerrorCooper","date":". 07-22-2020, 05:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-22T09:04:36-07:00","id":1404039,"title":"","content":"And most demons would be focused heavily on the questions &quot;can i made pacts with them?&quot;<br /> And &quot;does the god machine exists on their home planet?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-10T07:29:01-07:00","id":1412847,"title":"","content":"I've been working on this one bit by bit. In my mind, the majority of official splats are caught totally off guard. However, the aliens might not even know about things like spirits or the supernal realms and have their own belief sys